<title>USA: StaffMark says buys Temp Technology.</title>
<headline>StaffMark says buys Temp Technology.</headline>
<dateline>FAYETTEVILLE, Ark. 1997-08-05</dateline>
<text>
<p>StaffMark Inc said Tuesday that it acquired Temp Technology Inc, a staffing services firm headquartered in Beaverton, Ore.</p>
<p>Terms were not announced.</p>
<p>Temp Technology, with offices in Beaverton and Clackamas, Ore., had 1996 revenues of about $8.0 million, a news release issued by StaffMark said.</p>
<p>The transaction will be accounted for as an asset purchase, the news release said.</p>
